WEBVTT

00:05:29.603 --> 00:05:32.643
all of that artistic output.

00:05:32.643 --> 00:05:35.040
Now that Ethic’s delivered 
the furnace-bots,

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:38.500
Adila honors her end of the deal.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.401
She leads Ethic and Hedge 
to the location of the first artifact,

00:05:42.401 --> 00:05:44.980
the Node of Power.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:47.996
There, one thing is immediately clear:

00:05:50.086 --> 00:05:51.806
they’ll have to steal it.